{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25903","headline":"过小妓英英墓 · 杨虞卿","name":"过小妓英英墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧晨骑马出皇都，闻说埋冤在路隅。\n别我已爲泉下土，思君犹似掌中珠。\n四弦品柱声初绝，三尺孤坟草已枯。\n兰质蕙心何所在，焉知过者是狂夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨虞卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}